# Client Management App

A full-stack CRUD application for managing client details.

## Stack
- **Backend:** Spring Boot 2.7.18, Spring Security, JJWT, H2/PostgreSQL
- **Frontend:** React (Vite) + TypeScript, React Router DOM, Axios

## Structure
- `/cm-backend` — Spring Boot REST API
- `/cm-frontend` — React SPA

## Features
- User registration & login (username OR email)
- JWT-based authentication with expiry handling
- Group-based authorization (read, create, update, delete)
- Full CRUD for clients